{"version":1,"content":"<p>有關婚外情的報道曝出後，英偉達董事會召開會議，商討是否解除黃仁勳的行政總裁職務，英偉達股票周四應聲下跌。據報道，黃仁勳與 Megaspeed 高管艾麗斯・黃存在戀愛關係。黃仁勳還與英偉達醫療健康業務副總裁金伯利・鮑威爾存在婚外情，鮑威爾直接向黃仁勳匯報工作。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586080.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:23:53.007266+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T12:14:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_hash":"391b42a4aa446383b27861032e797497dc38e57ff1823914c25880c729f71ad0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}